            c.lm_compiler_ns_exec_scan_body((cast: (const: @: c.LmP0Structure) m_body_cell[0][i]\as\structure), i)
        i: i + 1
    ---
    # Any original definition uses the same body producer. An adapter without
    # one must not silently discard its executable statements.
