        # occurrence, NODE(0) -- a split-called code's, and a four-part fn's, whose unary data (holder 0) is its var
        # part and holds no body -- or, for an occurrence that is its own data, the data itself, SELF.  The place's
        # child is a SOURCE-CODE EDGE of the body's layout: OF_EDGE projects it at run time through the execution map
        # of the occurrence that holds the body's values -- the code's (lmx_implements_exec_index(l2_call_code, ...)
        # natively), or the data's (self + lmx_implements_code_index natively: a merge result executing the selected
        # body is code = data = the result, whose layout is not the body's).  Not a physical child, not a receiving
