    # activation's data, and a four-part fn's places hang from its code too (l2_m_code_rooted, as the native root l2_call_code):
    # a path rooted at the current one starts at NODE(0) -- the one predicate the frames over it read (l2_rw_path_code_root).
    if: c.lm_compiler_rw_path_code_root(path, level) != 0
        return: (cast: (int) (c.lm_compiler_rw_code_root(parent, out)))
